This directory is for testing only.  Will be deleted

How to test the ingest of data of a completed run (without really running a calibration).

Create a calibration run that has all needed data (READY).  Easiest way is to Import.  Select the Algorithm to test (DDS, GWO, or PSO)

Create JSON data which matches the workers names (Peterx 100, 101, or 102) and run_id
run kge_report_iteration with the appropriate input

Copy the kge_xxx directory from one of the Peterx users to the newly created run
